{"unit_id":"hige6__imgpost#feature-send-image","repo":"hige6/imgpost","commit":"e94fd62c19f8d43150f8c2496a263a8e0f6de11f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"图邮（imgpost）的「发送图片」功能：把本地文件、网页图片或 base64 图片保存为对话附件并回显。通过 send_image 工具触发，可附带说明文字和显示名称。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:1615-1625"]}
{"unit_id":"hige6__imgpost#feature-generate-image","repo":"hige6/imgpost","commit":"e94fd62c19f8d43150f8c2496a263a8e0f6de11f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"图邮（imgpost）的「生成图片」功能：把文字提示发送到已配置的兼容生图服务，并将返回图片保存为附件显示在对话中。通过 generate_image 工具触发，可指定提示词、尺寸和模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:1684-1686"]}
{"unit_id":"hige6__imgpost#feature-read-image","repo":"hige6/imgpost","commit":"e94fd62c19f8d43150f8c2496a263a8e0f6de11f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"图邮（imgpost）的「识读图片」功能：把图片交给配置的视觉服务，返回描述、OCR 文本或针对图片问题的回答。通过 imgpost_read_image 工具触发，可提供本地路径、网址或附件编号并指定问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:1763-1772"]}
{"unit_id":"hige6__imgpost#feature-settings","repo":"hige6/imgpost","commit":"e94fd62c19f8d43150f8c2496a263a8e0f6de11f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"图邮（imgpost）的「视觉后端设置」功能：在 DSH 设置页填写主、备用视觉后端，并编辑 provider 包装名单。页面通过图邮配置接口读取和保存设置，保存后即时生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:226-245"]}
